            <sparkle:version>153</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.13.46</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.46

- A track with a long credit list no longer stretches the menu bar menu across the display. macOS sizes a menu to its widest row and never shortens text, so a song crediting a dozen singers pulled every other row out with it. Title, artist and source now clip at a word boundary, and the menu keeps a steady width whatever is playing.
]]></description>
